== What's New

ifdef::pro[]



endif::pro[]

=== Node Channel Control Improvements
--
The node_channel_control table now includes a target_node_id column. This makes it possible to suspend or ignore synchronization
between two specific nodes in an individual direction. For ease of use and increased visibility, SymmetricDS now synchronizes this
table between nodes via the config channel. In addition, the behavior of this table is more consistent and no longer affected by
the group link's data event action. When upgrading to 3.17, all rows will be deleted from the node_channel_control table. 
--
